      "committedAt": "2026-07-01T07:19:28-06:00",
      "subject": "fix(agents): stop the profile spec card clipping its content when the app is short",
      "body": "The spec card (Org/IP/Wallet + channel icons + nav links) is a flex child of the\nsidekick's flex-column scroll area and also has `overflow: hidden`. That makes it\na scroll container, so its automatic min-height resolves to 0 instead of its\ncontent size — letting the default flex-shrink compress it whenever the window is\nshort, at which point `overflow: hidden` clips the rows. Add `flex-shrink: 0` so\nthe card's height follows its content; the scroll area (overflow-y: auto) handles\nany spillover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "parents": [
